        "evidence": "The plan acknowledges that the response field names and currency parameter are unverified, and instructs the operator to edit `fetch_cheapest`/`build_purchase_link` after the first live run if they differ. In that scenario `fetch_cheapest` returns `None`, so a daemon started with valid tokens silently produces no observations or alerts until source code is modified. That does not satisfy the operational acceptance criteria or the configuration-only adjustment model.",
